  "bio": "Atattooed Tattoo Shop, nestled in the heart of Bray, Ireland, specializes in striking realism and monochromatic black & gray ink masterpieces. Clients can expect a pristine, welcoming studio where artistry and precision come to life on skin. Bookings are available via phone at 01 204 2470 or email at atattooed@atattooed.com for a bespoke tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bray, Ireland"
